keys={{277507,"Dalaran Sewer Key",true,"Opens the sewer entrance into Dalaran by the Lordamere Lake. It comes with the quest Heart of Disruption from the Image of Archmage Modera; the Alliance gets there with one lead-in quest, the Horde with Magus Wordeen Voidglare's quests in Tarren Mill.",{{"An Alarming Request","Emissary Jacques, Hillsbrad Foothills (48.3, 60.0)","Report to the Image of Archmage Modera near the City of Dalaran."},{"Heart of Disruption","Image of Archmage Modera, Alterac Mountains (14.3, 59.6)","Accept this quest: the Dalaran Sewer Key comes with it."},{"Prison Break In","Magus Wordeen Voidglare, Hillsbrad Foothills (61.6, 20.9)","Find the traitors and recover their artifacts, then return to Magus Voidglare in Tarren Mill."},{"Key to the City","Magus Wordeen Voidglare, Hillsbrad Foothills (61.6, 20.9)","Loot the Grimy Key from a Warden's Footlocker upstairs in a house of the Lordamere Internment Camp (guarded by Warden Belamoore) and bring it to Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill."},{"Dalaran Patrols","Magus Wordeen Voidglare, Hillsbrad Foothills (61.6, 20.9)","Kill 6 Dalaran Summoners and 12 Elemental Slaves, then return to Magus Voidglare in Tarren Mill."},{"Blood in the Streets","Magus Wordeen Voidglare, Hillsbrad Foothills (61.6, 20.9)","Find a way into Dalaran along the Lordamere Lake."},{"Heart of Disruption","Image of Archmage Modera, Alterac Mountains (14.3, 59.6)","Accept this quest: the Dalaran Sewer Key comes with it."}}}},
