keys={{13704,"Skeleton Key",true,"Opens the gate of Scholomance in Caer Darrow. Made by Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan from Imbued Skeletal Fragments; the last step is a quest for your faction.",{{"A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!","Crier Goodman, Stormwind City (56.4, 74.1)","Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist. His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains."},{"Clear the Way","Commander Ashlam Valorfist, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 84.0)","Kill 10 Skeletal Flayers and 10 Slavering Ghouls in Sorrow Hill.  Return to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands."},{"All Along the Watchtowers","Commander Ashlam Valorfist, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 84.0)","Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.  Once all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands."},{"Scholomance","Commander Ashlam Valorfist, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 84.0)","Speak with Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands."},{"Skeletal Fragments","Alchemist Arbington, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 83.8)","Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands."},{"Mold Rhymes With...","Alchemist Arbington, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 83.8)","Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan."},{"Fire Plume Forged","Krinkle Goodsteel, Tanaris (51.5, 28.8)","Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.  Bring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands."},{"Araj's Scarab","Alchemist Arbington, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 83.8)","Destroy Araj the Summoner and bring Araj's Scarab to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands."},{"The Key to Scholomance","Alchemist Arbington, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 83.8)",""},{"A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!","Warcaller Gorlach, Orgrimmar (37.6, 75.4)","Seek out High Executor Derrington. His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity."},{"Scarlet Diversions","High Executor Derrington, Tirisfal Glades (83.1, 68.9)","Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent.  Place the Scourge banner at the camp, and then return to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."},{"All Along the Watchtowers","High Executor Derrington, Tirisfal Glades (83.1, 68.9)","Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.  Once all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."},{"Scholomance","High Executor Derrington, Tirisfal Glades (83.1, 68.9)","Speak with Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."},{"Skeletal Fragments","Apothecary Dithers, Tirisfal Glades (83.3, 69.2)","Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."}}}},
