{n="Onyxia's Lair",lo=60,hi=60,loc="Dustwallow Marsh",desc="The lair of the black dragon Onyxia, deep in the Wyrmbog of Dustwallow Marsh. A raid for 40 players, opening on 9 December 2026. You need the Drakefire Amulet to enter (see Attunement). The loot list holds the drops known so far; the full table follows once the raid is open.",icon="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Head_Dragon_Black",min=60,side="Contested",raid=1,size=40,status="Opens 9 December 2026",m=1445,x=52.6,y=76.8,
