keys={{16309,"Drakefire Amulet",true,"Needed to enter Onyxia's Lair. Each faction earns it at the end of a long quest chain that starts around level 50 (Alliance) or 55 (Horde) and leads through Blackrock Spire.",{{"Dragonkin Menace","Helendis Riverhorn, Burning Steppes (85.8, 69.0)","Slay 15 Black Broodlings, 10 Black Dragonspawn, 4 Black Wyrmkin and 1 Black Drake. Return to Helendis Riverhorn when the task is complete."},{"The True Masters","Helendis Riverhorn, Burning Steppes (85.8, 69.0)","Travel to Lakeshire and deliver Helendis Riverhorn's Letter to Magistrate Solomon."},{"The True Masters","Magistrate Solomon, Redridge Mountains (24.9, 44.5)","Travel to Stormwind and deliver Solomon's Plea to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.  Bolvar resides in Stormwind Keep."},{"The True Masters","Highlord Bolvar Fordragon, Stormwind City (80.2, 38.4)","Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon after speaking with Lady Katrana Prestor."},{"The True Masters","Highlord Bolvar Fordragon, Stormwind City (80.2, 38.4)","Take Bolvar's Decree to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire. "},{"The True Masters","Magistrate Solomon, Redridge Mountains (24.9, 44.5)","Speak with Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes."},{"The True Masters","Marshal Maxwell, Burning Steppes (84.7, 69.0)","Speak with Ragged John to learn of Marshal Windsor's fate and return to Marshal Maxwell when you have completed this task.  You recall Marshal Maxwell telling you to search for him in a cave to the north."},{"Marshal Windsor","Marshal Maxwell, Burning Steppes (84.7, 69.0)","Travel to Blackrock Mountain in the northwest and enter Blackrock Depths. Find out what became of Marshal Windsor.  You recall Ragged John talking about Windsor being dragged off to a prison."},{"Abandoned Hope","Marshal Windsor, inside Blackrock Depths Shadowforge City","Give Marshal Maxwell the bad news."},{"A Crumpled Up Note","A Crumpled Up Note, a drop","You may have just stumbled on to something that Marshal Windsor would be interested in seeing. There may be hope, after all."},{"A Shred of Hope","Marshal Windsor, inside Blackrock Depths Shadowforge City","Return Marshal Windsor's Lost Information.  Marshal Windsor believes that the information is being held by Golem Lord Argelmach and General Angerforge."},{"Jail Break!","Marshal Windsor, inside Blackrock Depths Shadowforge City","Help Marshal Windsor get his gear back and free his friends. Return to Marshal Maxwell if you succeed."},{"Stormwind Rendezvous","Marshal Maxwell, Burning Steppes (84.7, 69.0)","Travel to Stormwind City and venture to the city gates. Speak with Squire Rowe so that he may let Marshal Windsor know that you have arrived."},{"The Great Masquerade","Reginald Windsor","Follow Reginald Windsor through Stormwind. Protect him from harm!"}}}},
